<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday, slaughter steers and heifers sold mostly $0.50-1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1175-1475 lbs 63.85-65.60. Select and choice 2-3 1050-1480 lbs 62.50-63.75.  Select 2-3 1150-1400 lbs 60.25-62.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1000-1365 lbs 62.75-64.00. Select 2-3 1075-1350 lbs 61.50-62.75.  Select 2-3 1100-1375 lbs 57.75-61.50.</p>
</text>
